ps.apple.com/us/app/rouge/id6799992309\" rel=\"nofollow\">商店链接</a> 下载，目前早期版本售价：2$，后续功能完善后可能会涨价。</p>\n<p>同时欢迎大家加入 TF 参与测试： <a href=\"https://testflight.apple.com/join/15CTWsQW\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://testflight.apple.com/join/15CTWsQW</a></p>\n<p>最后评论区送 10 个兑换码。</p>\n","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236360","replies":35,"created_ts":1787366591,"title":"[送码] 做了一个 Apple tv 上的小红书 Rouge","author":"mdah233","author_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/u/mdah233","author_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1ae7/5aad/386500_mini.png?m=1787365823"},{"id":1236355,"node":"问与答","node_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/go/qna","node_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_mini.png?m=1777132346","description":"<p>之前出去浪, 把皮肤晒脱皮了, 最近俩月往回调, 感觉似乎的确比之前很了很多, </p>\n<p>而且肤色不均了, 脸/脖子/大腿/小腿 四个颜色.</p>\n<p>比如水杨酸/烟氨酸/377 这种各种乱七八糟的元素, 基本上可以出现在洗面奶/面霜/沐浴露/面膜, 等等各种乱七八糟的地方, 能查到的都是各种带货, 也不知道有没有用.</p>\n<p>问下路过的兄弟, 你们都在用哪些护肤品? 有哪些有效的?</p>\n<p>我主要就是想找找美白和护肤的, 把肤色调整一下. 速效也行, 我不是敏感肌.</p>\n","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236355","replies":34,"created_ts":1787365707,"title":"纯直男求推荐一些靠谱的护肤/美白品,我对美妆完全不通.找资料看的头大感觉基本都是带货的.","author":"cvooc","author_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/u/cvooc","author_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0b15/0d66/525806_mini.png?m=1715683975"},{"id":1236362,"node":"推广","node_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/go/promotions","node_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/1fc2/1400/864_mini.png?m=1778522847","description":"<h1>Air Router：希望提供和呼吸一样便捷的 AI 服务</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>站点地址： <a href=\"https://www.air-router.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.air-router.com</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong>充值地址： <a href=\"https://catfk.com/shop/air-router\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://catfk.com/shop/air-router</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>价格</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>倍率</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>GPT Plus</td>\n<td><strong>0.1x</strong></td>\n<td>最近拉闸的很厉害，但依然比较稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPT Pro</td>\n<td><strong>0.2x</strong></td>\n<td>正价号池，非黑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>