33,"node":"生活","node_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/go/life","node_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_mini.png?m=1747623425","description":"<p>平时健身哈 肌酸啥的 鱼油有必要加吗？ </p>\n<p>主要是平时随餐的 VB 和葡萄糖酸辛片 很便宜的那种(记得好像是 tb 上的虎扑五件套)  就中午随餐两粒</p>\n<p>大家还有啥可以分享的？？</p>\n<p>自己平时也有眼袋 然后看 douyin 肝素钠。。但是发现自己用了 没啥效果 反而容易眼睛红。。。</p>\n","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236333","replies":31,"created_ts":1787358805,"title":"35+男士保养有哪些？？","author":"OBJECTION","author_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/u/OBJECTION","author_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6eec09bcb6ea9e653ab7cc4f45ad6027?s=24&d=retro"},{"id":1236410,"node":"分享创造","node_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/go/create","node_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/70ef/df2e/17_mini.png?m=1660301119","description":"<p>大家好，我开发的《像素数织》 Google Play 版本推进到封闭测试阶段了，想找几位平时喜欢益智游戏的朋友，帮我实际体验一下。</p>\n<p>《像素数织》是一款通过行列数字线索，还原像素图案的逻辑益智游戏。玩法比较简单：根据数字判断哪些格子应该填满，哪些格子应该留空，一步步推理，最后把隐藏的图案拼出来。</p>\n<p>它不太考验反应速度，主要是慢慢分析和排除。顺利解出一道比较大的题时，还是挺有成就感的。</p>\n<p>宣传截图如下：</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZLVsR7m.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hin9Pui.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CHOQOJ5.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/frDVchm.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CwwpUe7.png\"/> </p>\n<p>参与方式：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>需要有 Android 手机，并且可以正常使用 Google Play</li>\n<li>留下邮箱我会邀请加入测试，并发放邀请码，数量有限(50 个)</li>\n<li>实际体验几关，或者试试自由模式、创造模式</li>\n<li>遇到 Bug 或有建议，可以在帖子里回复，也可以私信告诉我</li>\n</ol>\n<p>感谢大家，也欢迎喜欢 Nonogram 、数织、逻辑拼图类游戏的朋友来试试。</p>\n<p>很少在 V 站发帖，如果发布的节点有问题还请见谅并告知，我会移动到合适位置。</p>\n<p>谢谢大家～</p>\n","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236410","replies":30,"created_ts":1787387491,"title":"[Android 封闭测试] 找几位朋友帮忙体验《像素数织》，送完整内容兑换码","author":"sherlockGou","author_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/u/sherlockGou","author_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/84cb577a710edcc54c5a4ff440537c6f?s=24&d=retro"},{"id":1236335,"node":"OpenAI","node_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/go/openai","node_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_mini.png?m=1751736785","description":"<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQSW6ceaUAAQjHQ.jpg\"/></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://codex-reset.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://codex-reset.com</a></p>\n<p>Tibo 原帖：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2090947196107764189\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2090947196107764189</a></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQSR-xXbgAEUHgL.jpg\"/></p>\n","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236335","replies":27,"created_ts":1787359283,"title":"Tibo 已发 重置卡 注意查收","author":"privateproxies","author_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/u/privateproxies","author_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7ee6/54c8/496412_mini.png?m=1787358843"},{"id":1236328,"node":"问与答","node_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/go/qna","node_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_mini.png?m=1777132346","description":"<p>不想自己打扫卫生了，想搞一个扫地拖地机器人，滚筒+上下水方案的，款式太多，哪个比较好啊，有懂的推荐一下吗？   价格 2000 多的，能打扫干净的，基台最好也能自己处理干净的，房子 50 多平米。谢谢。</p>\n","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236328","replies":23,"created_ts":1787349024,"title":"扫拖机器人 哪款比较好？","author":"luckyjoe","author_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/u/luckyjoe","author_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/068b7e99b3eade94f4599a136d0d9fc8?s=24&d=retro"}]